# Title: PowerShell Set-Acl On Windows Folder
# ID: 0944e002-e3f6-4eb5-bf69-3a3067b53d73
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-18
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects PowerShell scripts to set the ACL to a file in the Windows folder
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:*Set-Acl * AND cmdline:*-AclObject *)) AND (((OriginalFileName:"PowerShell.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"pwsh.dll")) OR ((process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe))) AND ((cmdline:*-Path \"C:\\Windows* OR cmdline:*-Path 'C:\\Windows* OR cmdline:*-Path %windir%* OR cmdline:*-Path $env:windir*)) AND ((cmdline:*FullControl* OR cmdline:*Allow*)))
